99&= x+100k
&99^{36}&=(x+100k)^{36}\\
&=(100k+x)^{36}
& &\{a^{n-1}=\binom{n}{n-1}a^{n-1}+...\pm1\}\\
&=\sum_{i=0}^{36}\binom{36}{i}(100k)^{36-i}(x)^{i}
& &\{\binom{n}{i}=\binom{n}{n-i}\}\\
&=\sum_{j=0}^{18}\binom{36}{j}(100k)^{36-(2j)}(x)^{(2j)}\\
\end{align*}
